# VendorMaster.sortspec — Sort specification for VendorMaster (date-effective history)
#
# VendorMaster is the Contract Attributes Record (CAR / Partition C).
# Sorted by instID ascending, then instEffectDate ascending.
# This order enables the streaming two-pointer as-of-date join in Step 5
# and the streaming reclass walk in arrangementReclass.scala (Step 9).
#
# field_name,       col_index, type, order
instID,             0,         CH,   A
instEffectDate,     1,         CH,   A
